  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Install:</strong> Hospital<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p>Paired Cyberarms with pre-installed TUped Techscanner (+3), Superchrome Covering, and 2 option slots. Allows user to Field Repair an item two times before a full repair is needed.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberarm (Foundational)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> provides 2</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One item is the pair of arms: install it once. Its 2 slots are the 2 option slots of each arm, so a paired option uses one of them.</li>\n<li>The built-in Techscanner and Superchrome Covering are this item's own effects (the core items' effects, with the Techscanner at +3) and use none of the slots.</li>\n<li>The second Field Repair is not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Cyberware).</em></p>"
